// "<performer> creates N <token>" [CR#701.7a]: the creating spell or ability
// defines the token's characteristics [CR#111.3,111.4]. Lean `create`, with
// the token argument typed `TokenSpec` rather than Lean's own
// `CharacteristicBundle` (the raw instruction's `spec` field wants the
// wider type; a caller writes `Written(characteristics: (...))`). The
// creator is the actor.
KeywordAction(
    name: "create",
    params: [Amount, TokenSpec],
    spelling: "create",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "create",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
    deed: None,
    body: createObject(Param(0), Token(Param(1), [])),
)
